    25	  config's. **Deviation:** eager model (`rl.model_compile: none`), because the
    26	  pod's NVIDIA driver 580.159.03 is not in the probed compile stack
    27	  (`owl.model.compile_gemm`, 595.91.07) and `train_bc.py` refuses it; this
    28	  costs throughput, not correctness. BF16 autocast and flash-attn 2.8.3 as
    29	  configured. W&B: no key on the pod, so `--wandb-mode offline` into the run
    30	  directory (telemetry outage stays visible; sync later if wanted).
    31	- **Expected observation.** Held-out policy NLL falls from its step-0 value and
    32	  either reaches a minimum then rises (L9 stop fires) or is still falling at the
    33	  cap (then the cap, not the data, limited selection).
    34	- **Stopping.** First of: best held-out NLL followed by the trainer's L9 stop
    35	  (10 scheduled evaluations x 200 steps without improvement), `max_steps`
    36	  100,000, the hard cap `--max-runtime-hours 2` (clock starts inside
    37	  `train_bc` after data load and model build, so preflight replay counts), or
    38	  a crash (diagnose once, fix only the obvious cause, relaunch).
    39	- **Budget.** Pod 23f7xiz368x9jf at $1.66/h; about 2.5 h wall including data
    40	  load, so about $4. No new billable resource.
    41	- **Artifacts.** Pod run dir under `/workspace/kg-v3-bc-2026-09-29/run/`
    42	  (`checkpoint_bc_best.pt` + `.json`, `bc_state.pt`, `bc_history.jsonl`,
    43	  `bc_result.json`, `bc_attempts.jsonl`, configs, offline W&B), launch log in
    44	  the same directory. Compact receipts (history, result, attempts, sidecar,
    45	  log excerpt, SHA-256, GPU samples) copied to
    46	  `ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/bc-a100-2026-09-29/`.
    47	- **Safety.** Read-only on existing `/workspace` data; new outputs only under
    48	  `/workspace/kg-v3-bc-2026-09-29/run/`; scratch under `/root`. No driver,
    49	  CUDA or torch changes; no credentials printed or committed. The pod is left
    50	  running after the run; the owner decides when to stop it.
