    36	## Memory check and stride
    37	
    38	- `bytes_per_turn_row` = 216612 (printed at startup).
    39	- Stride 1 would give 523 x 719 = 376037 rows, about 81.5 GB (75.9 GiB) resident,
    40	  over the about-60 GB budget of the pod's 125 GB container limit.
    41	- Deviation from the brief: `--resident-budget-gib 60` was **not** used.
    42	  `stride_for_budget` counts every listed episode (4198 x 719), not the team's
    43	  kept episodes, so it would have chosen stride 11 (about 34k rows). The same
    44	  formula applied to the 523 kept episodes gives
    45	  ceil(376037 / floor(60 GiB / 216612) = 297418) = 2, so the run used
    46	  `--turn-stride 2` explicitly. Resident size: 188021 rows x 216612 = about
    47	  40.7 GB.
    48	- Open gap: `--resident-budget-gib` over-strides whenever `--team` filters most
    49	  episodes. It was not changed here.
